hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"388","On the authority of Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Dawrqi, on the authority of Hisham, on the authority of Hajjaj, on the authority of Aoun ibn Abi Juhayfa, on the authority of his father, he said: “I saw Bilal giving the call to prayer, And he put his fingers in his ears and twisted his ears to the right and to the left.”"
